## 任务：生成 fig2 + fig3 规范数据 JSON 文件

### 背景
需要从已有实验结果中提取规范数据，写成 Paper Agent 可直接使用的 JSON 文件。

### 环境
- 服务器: autodl-rtx6000
- CPU only (纯数据提取)
- 项目路径: /root/autodl-tmp/contrastive_trace_safety
- 数据来源:
  - artifacts/r1_8b_balanced_recompute/full_results.json (r1-8b HS 全 metrics)
  - artifacts/text_window_ablation_r1_8b/results.json (r1-8b text window ablation)
  - artifacts/exp_007_window_ablation/results.json (HS window ablation 3 models)
  - artifacts/acc_precision_bootstrap/report.md 或相关 json
  - artifacts/r1_8b_bootstrap_hs_text/results.json (r1-8b FPR bootstrap)
  - artifacts/qwq_text_verify/bootstrap_results.json (QwQ bootstrap)
  - artifacts/exp_001a/bootstrap_hs_vs_text_fpr.json (R1-32B bootstrap)
  - artifacts/m001_layer_fix/ (M001 corrected 32B results)
  - artifacts/hs_vs_text_acc_prec.json (acc/precision per model)

### 输出 1: artifacts/paper_data/fig2_temporal_improvement.json

```json
{
  "r1_8b_hs": {
    "W=1": {"bal_acc": ..., "precision": ..., "precp_fpr": ..., "coverage": ...},
    "W=5": {...},
    "W=10": {...},
    "W=15": {...},
    "W=25": {...}
  },
  "r1_8b_text": {
    "W=1": {"bal_acc": ..., "precision": ..., "precp_fpr": ..., "coverage": ...},
    "W=5": {...},
    "W=10": {...},
    "W=15": {...},
    "W=25": {...}
  },
  "r1_32b_best": {
    "hs": {"window": 10, "layer": 10, "bal_acc": ..., "precision": ..., "precp_fpr": ..., "coverage": ...},
    "text": {"window": 10, "bal_acc": ..., "precision": ..., "precp_fpr": ..., "coverage": ...}
  },
  "qwq_32b_best": {
    "hs": {"window": 5, "layer": 2, "bal_acc": ..., "precision": ..., "precp_fpr": ..., "coverage": ...},
    "text": {"window": 5, "bal_acc": ..., "precision": ..., "precp_fpr": ..., "coverage": ...}
  }
}
```

### 输出 2: artifacts/paper_data/fig3_bootstrap_ci.json

```json
{
  "r1_8b": {
    "n_test": 43,
    "accuracy": {"hs": ..., "text": ..., "diff": ..., "ci_95": [..., ...], "p": ...},
    "precision": {"hs": ..., "text": ..., "diff": ..., "ci_95": [..., ...], "p": ...},
    "fpr": {"hs": ..., "text": ..., "diff": ..., "ci_95": [..., ...], "p": ...}
  },
  "r1_32b": {
    "n_test": 20,
    "accuracy": {...},
    "precision": {...},
    "fpr": {...}
  },
  "qwq_32b": {
    "n_test": 19,
    "accuracy": {...},
    "precision": {...},
    "fpr": {...}
  },
  "bonferroni_alpha": 0.0167
}
```

### 注意
- 所有数值从源文件直接读取，不要手动编造
- 如果某个数据点在源文件中不存在（如 32B text window ablation 只有 best-W），标注为 null
- 确保与 registry 中的 metrics 一致
- 如果需要查看更多结果文件以获取 CI 数据，检查 artifacts/ 下的所有 json/md 文件

### 完成后
确认两个 JSON 文件已写入 artifacts/paper_data/

